    "id": "diagnose-attention-bottlenecks",
    "kind": "skill",
    "entrypoint": "systems/platforms/cuda/diagnose-attention-bottlenecks/SKILL.md",
    "title": "Diagnose the next attention-kernel bottleneck after IO reduction using evidence about HBM traffic, work ownership, parallelism, scalar work, asynchronous scheduling and precision. Produce a bounded optimization hypothesis and correctness-first verification plan; do not infer current library support or NPU portability from GPU papers.",
    "origin": [
      "external"
    ],
